          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 5,
          "text_preview": "4. Composition, Elections, and Reservations"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e22",
          "sequence_order": 22,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 14,
          "text_preview": "The Act ensures a democratic composition for all three tiers, with direct elections and"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e23",
          "sequence_order": 23,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 5,
          "text_preview": "robust provisions for social inclusion."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e24",
          "sequence_order": 24,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 2,
          "text_preview": "Direct Elections"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e25",
          "sequence_order": 25,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 14,
          "text_preview": "Members of Grama, Block, and District Panchayats are directly elected by the voters of"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e26",
          "sequence_order": 26,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "their respective territorial constituencies (wards) for a term of five years. The State"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e27",
          "sequence_order": 27,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 9,
          "text_preview": "Election Commission is solely responsible for conducting these elections."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e28",
          "sequence_order": 28,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "noise_detected"
          ],
          "token_count": 3,
          "text_preview": "Progressive Reservation Policy"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e29",
          "sequence_order": 29,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 11,
          "text_preview": "Kerala is recognized nationally for its pioneering steps in ensuring inclusive"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e30",
          "sequence_order": 30,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 4,
          "text_preview": "governance through statutory reservations:"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e31",
          "sequence_order": 31,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 11,
          "text_preview": "Women Empowerment: Kerala amended the Act in 2009 to increase the"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e32",
          "sequence_order": 32,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 15,
          "text_preview": "reservation for women from 33% to 50%. This applies not just to the seats of"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e33",
          "sequence_order": 33,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 15,
          "text_preview": "members across all three tiers, but also to the offices of the President and Vice-"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e34",
          "sequence_order": 34,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 1,
          "text_preview": "President."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e35",
          "sequence_order": 35,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 12,
          "text_preview": "Scheduled Castes (SC) and Scheduled Tribes (ST): Seats are reserved strictly in"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e36",
          "sequence_order": 36,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 11,
          "text_preview": "proportion to their population in the respective Panchayat area. Furthermore, 50%"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e37",
          "sequence_order": 37,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 13,
          "text_preview": "of the seats reserved for SC/ST categories are earmarked for women belonging to"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e38",
          "sequence_order": 38,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [
            "low_content"
          ],
          "token_count": 2,
          "text_preview": "those communities."
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e39",
          "sequence_order": 39,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
          "token_count": 5,
          "text_preview": "5. Authorities and Committee System"
        },
        {
          "element_id": "111_p4_e40",
          "sequence_order": 40,
          "page_number": 4,
          "quality_score": 0.0,
          "element_type": "paragraph",
          "reason": [],
